-- supabase/bootstrap/README.md).
--
-- HOW TO RUN: Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor -> paste this entire
-- file -> Run, once. Wrapped in one transaction: if any statement
-- fails, nothing commits, so a failed run is always safe to fix and
-- retry without manual cleanup.
